      "content": "<h3>Your first HashMap program</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>put(key, value)</code> adds a pair; <code>get(key)</code> returns the value or <code>null</code> if the key is missing.</li>\n<li>Printing a map shows <code>{key=value, key=value}</code>.</li>\n<li>Putting the same key again <strong>replaces</strong> the value and returns the old one.</li>\n</ul>",
