      "content": "<h3>All HashMap methods at a glance</h3>\n<p><em>n</em> is the number of entries.</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;\">\n<tr><th style=\"text-align:left;\">Method</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">What it does</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">Time</th></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>put(k, v)</strong> / <strong>putAll(m)</strong> / <strong>putIfAbsent(k, v)</strong></td><td>Adds or replaces / adds a whole map / adds only if the key is missing</td><td>O(1)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>get(k)</strong> / <strong>getOrDefault(k, d)</strong></td><td>Reads a value (null / default when missing)</td><td>O(1)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>containsKey(k)</strong> / <strong>containsValue(v)</strong></td><td>Tests for a key / for a value</td><td>O(1) / O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>remove(k)</strong> / <strong>remove(k, v)</strong></td><td>Removes by key / only if it has that value</td><td>O(1)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>replace(k, v)</strong> / <strong>replaceAll(f)</strong></td><td>Replaces one value / transforms every value</td><td>O(1) / O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>compute(k, f)</strong> / <strong>computeIfAbsent(k, f)</strong> / <strong>computeIfPresent(k, f)</strong></td><td>Calculates the new value for a key</td><td>O(1)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>merge(k, v, f)</strong></td><td>Inserts v, or combines the old value and v with f</td><td>O(1)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>keySet()</strong> / <strong>values()</strong> / <strong>entrySet()</strong></td><td>Live views of the keys / values / pairs</td><td>O(1) to create</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>forEach(f)</strong></td><td>Runs an action for every pair</td><td>O(n + capacity)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>size()</strong> / <strong>isEmpty()</strong> / <strong>clear()</strong></td><td>Count, emptiness, remove all</td><td>O(1) / O(1) / O(capacity)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>clone()</strong> / <strong>equals</strong> / <strong>hashCode</strong> / <strong>toString</strong></td><td>Copy and compare</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Map.of(...)</strong> / <strong>Map.entry(k, v)</strong> / <strong>Map.copyOf(m)</strong></td><td>Immutable maps and entries</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n</table>"
